            "review_title": "Review at 2D Cafe",
            "review_text": "Kaylee Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\nNice Black and White cafe in district 7, HCM\nOct 2020 • Family\nCame here with my mom and ordered one Apple tea and one Pineapple Tea. Their service was good. Baristas was so kind to us. The menu was in reasonable prices and i think our drinks worth with the price, 45k VND. \nDefinitely will come back here again. Nice place for check-in photos 😃\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 7, 2020",
